@host = http://localhost

### Login (stores the token for the requests below)
POST {{host}}/api/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Create an order (replace the product ids with existing ones; the order id is a client-generated UUIDv4)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "{{$uuid}}",
  "products": [
    { "product_id": "01a0f2e3-ddf4-76de-9eb0-4432e30510cb", "quantity": 2 },
    { "product_id": "01a0f2e3-ddf6-7a89-9b31-7e33aea1f8ce", "quantity": 3 }
  ]
}
